  "type": "MCQ",
  "question": "Let $f(x)=ax^3+bx^2+cx+d$ be a polynomial of degree $3$ where $a,b,c,d$ are real. Then",
  "options": {
    "A": "$f(x)\to\\infty$ as $x\to\\infty$;",
    "B": "$f$ is 1-1 as well as onto;",
    "C": "the graph of $f(x)$ meets the $x$-axis in one or three points;",
    "D": "$f$ must be onto but need not be 1-1."
  },
  "answer": "D",
